new file mode 100644
index 0000000..478da67
--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/shipshape-methodology.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@
+Feature: Shipshape methodology conformance
+  As the Shipshape harness
+  I want methodology rules to surface as failing verification
+  So that process drift is caught at harbour rather than in a green run
+
+  Rule: Methodology checks
+
+  @captain @conformance
+  Scenario: The watchbill conforms to its fixed shape
+    When the watchbill at the project root is validated against its fixed shape
+    Then an absent watchbill conforms and a present watchbill lists only "<spec>.feature:<Scenario Name>" or tier-tag references
+
+  @captain @conformance
+  Scenario: A green tree carries no standing PERTURBATION token
+    When the implementation directories are searched for the token "PERTURBATION"
+    Then no production file matches the PERTURBATION token
